#ASSERT NOT `the person is presumed to be the litterer` `an owner who was overseas`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is presumed to be the litterer` `a tenant who named a flatmate within 14 days`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is presumed to be the litterer` `an owner who proved the cleaner did it`

